00:11:14.238 --> 00:11:16.593
And I just forgot that
that was like a thing.

00:11:17.889 --> 00:11:19.600
We started just talking and I was like,

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.273
I had literally just
checked into my hotel.

00:11:21.273 --> 00:11:22.810
I just got off the flight.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.340
I was like-
- what did he say to you?

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:26.857
- He was just like, he
was talking about like--

00:11:26.857 --> 00:11:28.300
- Did you say hi?

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.250
