middle of a rice field

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.660
and they'll still somehow find a way

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.800
to crucify you.
- [Garnt] Exactly.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.190
- And it was just like so strange,

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:46.140
just seeing everything
kind of back to normal.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:48.120
It was like the UK just took the route of,

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.593
we don't give a shit anymore open back up.

00:16:52.792 --> 00:16:53.625
But the rules are different as well

00:16:53.625 --> 00:16:54.650
between England and Wales.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.440
And because I was traveling between them,

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.700
on Wales trains, you have to wear a mask,

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.550
on English trains, you
don't have to wear a mask.

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.820
But some trains go from Wales to England.

00:17:02.820 --> 00:17:03.820
So what happens is,

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.720
is that when you get into England,

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.173
people just took off
their masks on the train.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.440
