the whole point of...

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:18.100
Not that I think one of
either is wrong or right,

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:18.933
I'm just like,

00:17:18.933 --> 00:17:20.890
It invalidates with both

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.507
that you have to put it on off.

00:17:23.507 --> 00:17:24.890
You're on the same God damn train.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.893
It was, whatever.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.440
- That's like you being on a flight

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.273
and then like,

00:17:30.273 --> 00:17:32.630
