00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.850
(group chattering)

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:37.880
- COVID is like, "Okay
guys, I'ma head back now."

00:17:38.736 --> 00:17:40.970
- Sir, I can't survive
in this jurisdiction.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:41.995
I need to get back.

00:17:41.995 --> 00:17:43.420
(all laughing)

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.610
- So, it's like, "Okay,
that's kind of weird."

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.790
And I was wearing a mask

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.890
and I thought this was
early, like in America,

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.047
but someone came up to me and was like,

00:17:52.047 --> 00:17:53.520
"Take off your mask."

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.353
- What?

00:17:54.353 --> 00:17:55.186
- Yes, someone came up to me and was like,

00:17:55.186 --> 00:17:56.185
"Take off your mask."

00:17:56.185 --> 00:17:57.310
And I was like, "I don't think I will."

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.200
And then he was like, "Why?"

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.213
- Where were you?

00:18:00.213 --> 00:18:01.660
- I was in Wales.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.744
He was saying-
- Where you have

00:18:02.744 --> 00:18:03.750
to wear a mask, right?

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.130
Still in Wales?
- No, no, no, you don't.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.430
