00:32:34.450 --> 00:32:35.730
'cause I didn't wanna bog down that video.

00:32:35.730 --> 00:32:37.420
We are just complaining for nine hours.

00:32:37.420 --> 00:32:39.439
So we are gonna complain
on Trash Taste right now.

00:32:39.439 --> 00:32:42.800
So this whole thing is confusing, right?

00:32:42.800 --> 00:32:45.640
So normally, if you want a negative test,

00:32:45.640 --> 00:32:47.700
most test providers would give you a form,

00:32:47.700 --> 00:32:49.360
say, "Hey, you're negative.

00:32:49.360 --> 00:32:50.193
Take this."

00:32:50.193 --> 00:32:53.110
And then everyone will
accept it, normally.

00:32:53.110 --> 00:32:54.540
Problem is, Japan doesn't work like that.

00:32:54.540 --> 00:32:56.860
Japan just decided, we've gotta do things

00:32:56.860 --> 00:32:57.940
a little bit different.

00:32:57.940 --> 00:32:59.040
- We doing it our way.

00:33:00.550 --> 00:33:03.310
- It's literally our way or the highway.

00:33:03.310 --> 00:33:05.910
- It's like, "how about
we just give you a form

00:33:05.910 --> 00:33:07.730
that you need to fill
out the very specific way

00:33:07.730 --> 00:33:09.210
that we want it filled out."

00:33:09.210 --> 00:33:13.250
And this just sends fear
down, anyone who knows Japan,

00:33:13.250 --> 00:33:14.690
'cause you know they're not playing games.

00:33:14.690 --> 00:33:18.400
I have heard that some
airlines will let you on

00:33:18.400 --> 00:33:20.170
with the negative test, and
you don't need that one,

00:33:20.170 --> 00:33:21.640
but why would you risk it?

00:33:21.640 --> 00:33:24.407
So, I was shitting
myself, 'cause I was like,

00:33:24.407 --> 00:33:25.880
"How the fuck do I fill out this form?"

00:33:25.880 --> 00:33:30.010
So this form needs to be
signed and stamped by a doctor.

00:33:30.010 --> 00:33:32.550
It can't be a nurse,
it has to be a doctor.

00:33:32.550 --> 00:33:34.260
The test can be administered by a nurse,

00:33:34.260 --> 00:33:37.009
but it has to be signed
and stamped by a doctor.

00:33:37.009 --> 00:33:39.610
So, the most testing
facilities don't have a doctor

00:33:39.610 --> 00:33:41.410
who's gonna stamp or sign it for you.

00:33:41.410 --> 00:33:43.300
So then now, you have to find a place

00:33:43.300 --> 00:33:44.970
that has a doctor that will stamp it.

00:33:44.970 --> 00:33:46.640
Turns out like none of these test centers

00:33:46.640 --> 00:33:47.680
have doctors that are willing

00:33:47.680 --> 00:33:48.950
to sign or stamp things for you.

00:33:48.950 --> 00:33:51.760
So I managed to find,

00:33:51.760 --> 00:33:54.600
I found after I basically...

00:33:54.600 --> 00:33:57.680
I went to the UK government
website and got the email

00:33:57.680 --> 00:33:59.860
of every single test
provider they recognize

00:33:59.860 --> 00:34:01.510
and sent out a mass email to all of them.

00:34:01.510 --> 00:34:02.810
This was a big mistake,

00:34:02.810 --> 00:34:04.120
because then what ended up happening was,

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:05.283
it was one thread.

00:34:06.429 --> 00:34:07.503
(Garnt laughing)

00:34:07.503 --> 00:34:09.090
- They were all replying to each other.

00:34:09.090 --> 00:34:09.923
- No, no, no, no, no.

00:34:09.923 --> 00:34:11.150
It was a blank carbon copies,

00:34:11.150 --> 00:34:12.260
they weren't replying each other.

00:34:12.260 --> 00:34:14.160
But for me it was one thread.

00:34:14.160 --> 00:34:17.730
So I sent this email off
and within about 10 minutes,

00:34:17.730 --> 00:34:19.730
I realized the mistake that I'd made,

00:34:19.730 --> 00:34:22.710
because I had 15 replies in one thread

00:34:22.710 --> 00:34:24.013
and I couldn't keep track.

00:34:24.013 --> 00:34:25.770
- So, you basically opened a forum post?

00:34:25.770 --> 00:34:29.420
- I basically opened a forum
post directly to the person.

00:34:29.420 --> 00:34:31.810
And so, I got like 50
responses in the first day

00:34:31.810 --> 00:34:34.010
that all be like, "This is okay."

00:34:34.010 --> 00:34:35.367
But then some of them were like,

00:34:35.367 --> 00:34:36.830
"Yes, this is totally fine."

00:34:36.830 --> 00:34:40.676
But they didn't say yes to everything.

00:34:40.676 --> 00:34:43.960
So I had to then call
up places that said yes,

00:34:43.960 --> 00:34:44.997
and I walked them through it.

00:34:44.997 --> 00:34:46.820
And I was like, "Are
you sure this is okay?"

00:34:46.820 --> 00:34:48.447
And one of them was like,

00:34:48.447 --> 00:34:49.520
"Yeah, that's no problem.

00:34:49.520 --> 00:34:51.160
We've done it all the time.

00:34:51.160 --> 00:34:52.790
We've had people go to Japan all the time

00:34:52.790 --> 00:34:53.770
from our facility."

00:34:53.770 --> 00:34:54.603
And I'm like, "Great, okay."

00:34:54.603 --> 00:34:55.650
So I booked on with them

00:34:55.650 --> 00:34:57.350
150 pounds, it's like $200, right?

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:01.850
But, I know Japan.

00:35:01.850 --> 00:35:05.030
I know that I should have
a backup, just in case,

00:35:05.030 --> 00:35:07.170
'cause I don't fucking trust...

00:35:08.493 --> 00:35:10.310
'Cause you have to get it 72 hours before.

00:35:10.310 --> 00:35:14.360
So if I this up, I'm panicking
to try and find something.

00:35:14.360 --> 00:35:16.010
So I booked two.

00:35:16.010 --> 00:35:20.297
I booked another test,
but this place said,

00:35:20.297 --> 00:35:22.810
"Book a test with us, and then
when you get your results,

00:35:22.810 --> 00:35:25.180
three hours later, take those results

00:35:25.180 --> 00:35:27.890
and book a doctor appointment
and then get the doctor

00:35:27.890 --> 00:35:29.250
to sign and stamp it all."

00:35:29.250 --> 00:35:30.980
So I did that too.

00:35:30.980 --> 00:35:31.920
So I had that first.

00:35:31.920 --> 00:35:35.040
So I went to this testing
facility at 8:00 AM,

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:37.263
they shoved a thing up my nose, I'm dying.

00:35:38.110 --> 00:35:41.330
And then I get my results at
11:00 AM, and it's negative.

00:35:41.330 --> 00:35:42.163
And I'm like, "Great, great."

00:35:42.163 --> 00:35:44.590
So then I go to the doctor, and perfect!

00:35:44.590 --> 00:35:46.350
They sign it all, they stamp it all.

00:35:46.350 --> 00:35:48.400
It was all super easy.

00:35:48.400 --> 00:35:50.916
But I had to pay individually
for both of those things.

00:35:50.916 --> 00:35:53.270
It was like 150 pounds for the test again,

00:35:53.270 --> 00:35:55.210
or, no, 90 for that one,

00:35:55.210 --> 00:35:57.830
and then 90 for the doctor's appointment.

00:35:57.830 --> 00:36:01.793
So this is already like 400,
500 bucks, just on the test.

00:36:02.879 --> 00:36:05.900
- Not counting the amount
you have to pay for the test

00:36:05.900 --> 00:36:07.897
to get in the country as well.

00:36:07.897 --> 00:36:09.830
'Cause you have to pay for like...

00:36:11.446 --> 00:36:13.730
A lot of things people don't
consider is, I spend a lot.

00:36:13.730 --> 00:36:15.333
We both spent a lot on
just tests, basically.

00:36:15.333 --> 00:36:16.910
- Oh, we did so many tests.

00:36:16.910 --> 00:36:18.750
- Because you got to obviously get tested

00:36:18.750 --> 00:36:21.606
before you fly out of Japan to the UK.

00:36:21.606 --> 00:36:22.594
- That was like 150 bucks.

00:36:22.594 --> 00:36:23.987
