00:36:23.987 --> 00:36:25.330
And then you have to pay for another test

00:36:25.330 --> 00:36:26.880
when you land in the UK as well,

00:36:26.880 --> 00:36:29.260
which is also about 100 bucks.

00:36:29.260 --> 00:36:32.220
- Lots of tests, so many god damn tests.

00:36:32.220 --> 00:36:34.390
- If you're thinking traveling is just,

00:36:34.390 --> 00:36:36.900
you just have to consider
the cost of the airline,

00:36:36.900 --> 00:36:38.200
that's not a thing anymore.

00:36:38.200 --> 00:36:41.330
- Which also they've increased
the prices on the flights

00:36:41.330 --> 00:36:42.730
